Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||08-06-2001||06:02 AM||||Hi to all,  <P>I left at 7:30 AM (sun) and arrived home at 3:30 AM, about 940 miles !<P>Averaged 64.3 MPH for the return trip - That with pulling a trailer.<P>Anyone know of a good site to post my photos of the show ??<P>I took 147 !!  Got everyone's car.<P>I'll check in later for any responces  - It nite nite time for me !!!!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||LZeitgeist||08-06-2001||09:10 AM||||It was GREAT meeting you Thursday!!!<P>I was looking for you on Friday to see if you wanted to ride with me for the cruise (didn't figure you would want to put the extra miles on the GT), but I couldn't find you...<P>With all the confusion during the awards ceremony, I couldn't keep track of who was getting what for what, but lemme tell ya, if you didn't win *something* for that beast, YOU WUZ ROBBED!!!! That car is GORGEOUS. <P>Hope to see you again sometime. (Just stay outta my classification! LOL!)||||reg||1
Z||000002||skitime||08-06-2001||09:25 AM||||Hey CoolBlue glad to hear you got home safe.  Great talking with you again.  If you ever stop to visit in the area please call and stop over.  We will have a Fiero picnic for you since you couldn't make the last one.<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||LZeitgeist||08-06-2001||09:33 AM||||Hey, skitime!! Great to meet you, too!!<P>You got my vote for People's Choice... (and a few other people's that I know of...)<P>I absolutely *love* your car. If you wanted to sneak down here and make those mods to my Formula when I wasn't lookin', I promise to not be upset with you. 8)<P>Gang, you see those pics up there in skitime's sig? THEY DON'T DO THE CAR JUSTICE. It looks even *better* in person than in those pics. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||skitime||08-06-2001||10:10 AM||||Hey LZeitgeist, It was great meeting you too and hope to spend time with you again.  Thanks for the vote that really is a complement.  <BR> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||CoolBlue87GT||08-06-2001||10:31 AM||||Good morning to you both, I'm back up now, and busy downloading those 147 pic's !!!<P>I'll make a new post when there ready !!!<P>All the members will be able to check up out there cars.  I stood at the exit ramp of the hotel and snaped away as the cars drove out for the cruise !!||||reg||4
