Z||000007||CoolBlue87GT||08-06-2001||10:46 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR><B>Excellent! Can't wait!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Shouldn't be to much longer, it's on 70 now, about half down.<P>Boy, I still feel all keyed up from the drive. The rain I hit on the way home, started in Georiga, and ended about Sarasota.<P>The standing water in places was scary, as the Cherokee would hydroplane and that's a no no.<P>Can't wait to get the load leveler system that will make the front end more in contact with the road.<P>Well, back to brewing up the photo's||||reg||1
